<tr><th>Method</th><th>Releases lock?</th></tr>
<tr><td>yield()</td><td>No</td></tr>
<tr><td>join()</td><td>No</td></tr>
<tr><td>sleep()</td><td>No</td></tr>
<tr><td>wait()</td><td>Yes (immediately, that object)</td></tr>
<tr><td>notify()</td><td>Yes (but may not immediately)</td></tr>
<tr><td>notifyAll()</td><td>Yes (but may not immediately)</td></tr>
